WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-reelshort-6a3f6465934d3e8b110840c2 — Episode 1 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:16.220
Is that so?

2
00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:50.640
This manor and I will always be your safe haven.

3
00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:53.540
Thank you, Arthur. I'll be a devoted wife.

4
00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:57.240
I'm finally stepping into real high society, part man.

5
00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:59.540
I've waited ten years for this day.

6
00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:14.890
I won't allow it.

7
00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:17.490
Vincent! Watch your manners!

8
00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:18.790
This is Evelyn.

9
00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:21.890
She'll be your stepmother next month.

10
00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:23.090
Stepmother?

11
00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.890
You swore you'd never remarry. So why this?

12
00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:36.280
Some woman you barely know?

13
00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:41.770
How dare you wear my mother's necklace!

14
00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:43.770
I gave her the necklace!

15
00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:46.770
She's been dead ten years.

16
00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:49.770
I'm done mourning. Get out!

17
00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:56.150
Well, very well. I'm sorry, darling.

18
00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:59.550
Since his mother's death, Vincent has turned into this mess.

19
00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:01.750
He's nothing but a disgrace to the family.

20
00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:03.750
It's okay, Arthur.

21
00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:07.600
I will make him believe my sincerity.

22
00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.000
Vincent...

23
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:15.270
He's my stepson, and his eyes are just like a wild beast.
